+
+This file exists so "unidentified" can never be a silent default. Every model in `AGENT_GUARDRAILS.md` §3 gets a row. A model's status only changes when a specific free/remote source has actually been searched — not when someone judges it less likely than another model.
+
+**Constraint (see `PROJECT_METHODOLOGY.md`):** no institutional access, no paid research services, no travel. Every "Search targets" entry below must be reachable via free full-text search or a remote scan/microfilm request.
+
